        "TileImage": "$($repository 4ccedf53-aca3-4c34-8493-644b40c65f9f).Image",
        "Description": "Hello Agent 47, we have reports of a rogue guard and disgruntled fan in Miami. You must eliminate both Tristan Skinner, a racing fan who refuses to tell police about a crime she witnessed, as well as Gabriel Griffin, a guard who spends more time watching the race than his surroundings. Eliminate both as a silent assasin with suit only in as little time as possible. Good luck 47.",
